              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ijo ekek loka Isirael, ipotu kereka koinut eoŋ asuban ka ainakineta kamodiŋ ikar akaisaoŋon? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eebo, ipotu kodakata Sikut ekabakakus ka Kaiwan aputosiakus, aacerit naka edekekus, loipotu kiswamaut.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebala EJAKAIT, loerai ekekiror Edeke loka aioresio ebe, “Kanuka ŋun, ainakini yes aijoreoreo juwai Damasiko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.27"
            ]
          }
